<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml"
xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling"
xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata"
xml:lang="en">
<head>
</head>
<body>
<div>
<p begin="00:00:04.714" end="00:00:08.053">Vi tengo stretti stretti al cuore mio</p>
<p begin="00:00:08.986" end="00:00:13.178">in un addio lanciato d'altra sponda.</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.168" end="00:00:18.576">Ho scelto un'onda che si fa vettura</p>
<p begin="00:00:19.487" end="00:00:23.866">e n'abbia cura finché non vi trovi.</p>
<p begin="00:00:25.920" end="00:00:28.026">Magari in mezzo ai rovi che natura</p>
<p begin="00:00:28.677" end="00:00:30.656">a limitar dispone di foresta.</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.120" end="00:00:33.184">E pure dentro dove arbusti a festa</p>
<p begin="00:00:33.733" end="00:00:35.957">son certo v'hanno accolto banda in testa.</p>
<p begin="00:00:36.218" end="00:00:38.506">Un cicalar tra rami in cui si desta</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.810" end="00:00:41.157">la Sila nei richiami mattutini.</p>
<p begin="00:00:41.541" end="00:00:44.112">Aghi d'abeti e pini</p>
<p begin="00:00:47.055" end="00:00:49.274">che arrivano sui laghi d'altopiano.</p>
<p begin="00:00:49.658" end="00:00:50.693">Più in basso dei castagni</p>
<p begin="00:00:50.848" end="00:00:53.365">vi tendono la mano tra gli spini.</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.765" end="00:00:55.359">E querce secolari</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.509" end="00:00:57.983">in bagni di fogliame fan lo stesso.</p>
<p begin="00:00:58.160" end="00:01:02.538">Appresso a voi ci son vari animali</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.061" end="00:01:06.928">che fan del bosco favola silana.</p>
<p begin="00:01:08.239" end="00:01:10.069">Lo svolazzar dell’ali d’un falchetto</p>
<p begin="00:01:10.325" end="00:01:11.050">che insegue una poiana.</p>
<p begin="00:01:11.242" end="00:01:12.405">Un ragno ed una rana</p>
<p begin="00:01:12.586" end="00:01:13.717">sul letto d’uno stagno.</p>
<p begin="00:01:13.946" end="00:01:15.189">La volpe, un riccio e un lupo</p>
<p begin="00:01:15.381" end="00:01:16.421">che cupo si nasconde.</p>
<p begin="00:01:16.554" end="00:01:17.743">Le ronde dei cinghiali.</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.925" end="00:01:19.077">Un timido cerbiatto.</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.301" end="00:01:20.560">E un gatto delle nevi</p>
<p begin="00:01:20.784" end="00:01:22.079">qualora sia d’inverno.</p>
<p begin="00:01:22.261" end="00:01:23.354">Poi più all’interno tanti</p>
<p begin="00:01:23.482" end="00:01:28.869">scoiattoli volanti fra le fronde.</p>
<p begin="00:01:29.461" end="00:01:31.520">La giostra che confonde</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.690" end="00:01:34.693">un gufo triste invero rimbambito.</p>
<p begin="00:01:34.842" end="00:01:36.933">D’altronde non si muove.</p>
<p begin="00:01:37.109" end="00:01:40.133">Come se non avesse visto e udito.</p>
<p begin="00:01:40.394" end="00:01:42.277">Di nuove ci sta un tasso</p>
<p begin="00:01:42.463" end="00:01:46.506">che stenta a tener passo al vostro andare.</p>
<p begin="00:01:48.266" end="00:01:50.005">E dopo un altro tomo.</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.266" end="00:01:54.592">Una figura d’uomo che conosco.</p>
<p begin="00:01:58.549" end="00:02:00.656">Il bosco…</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.048" end="00:02:07.775">Il bosco. Il bosco.</p>
<p begin="00:02:08.917" end="00:02:11.455">Vi vedo camminare</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.064" end="00:02:16.645">seppure in mezzo il mare ci divide.</p>
<p begin="00:02:17.258" end="00:02:18.544">Un fungo…</p>
<p begin="00:02:18.885" end="00:02:22.485">Un fungo. Un fungo.</p>
<p begin="00:02:22.725" end="00:02:24.335">M’allungo.</p>
<p begin="00:02:24.538" end="00:02:33.077">Lo so che prima o dopo vi raggiungo.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>